          "heading": "Lewis Moody reveals wife Annie's promise to stay with him through MND",
          "body": "Moody told the High Performance podcast that his wife Annie has insisted she will stay present when he can no longer speak or move. \"She said she’d be there no matter what,\" he said. The former flanker, who revealed his diagnosis last year after noticing weakness in his shoulder during a gym session, also described the pain of telling his sons Dylan and Ethan. He says he is \"at peace\" with the condition, while acknowledging there is no known cure."
