          "kicker": "Injury update",
          "heading": "Ireland optimistic Sam Prendergast will be available against Argentina despite wrist injury",
          "body": "Sam Prendergast is edging closer to the Argentina opener after the wrist injury he picked up ahead of Leinster's Interpro with Munster last month. Assistant coach Paul O'Connell says the out-half has stepped up his training in recent days, moving in and out of non-contact drills close to full contact. \"So, I'm not 100% sure, but he looks like he could be OK.\" Prendergast appears to be the only injury concern in the group ahead of the first game of the window."
