          "kicker": "Coppa Italia",
          "heading": "Femi-CZ Rovigo clinch Coppa Italia semi-final place with 47-15 win at Vicenza",
          "body": "Rovigo's fourth-round trip to Vicenza ended in a bonus-point 47-15 win over Rangers, and that result settled their semi-final place. It also takes them top of Girone 1 on 20 points, five clear of Rangers in second on 15. The race for the second semi-final berth is wide open, with Parabiago on 12 and Mogliano on 10 still in contention, and the fifth and final round will decide it."
        },
