          "kicker": "Injury watch",
          "heading": "Ireland's Sam Prendergast edging back for Pumas after wrist injury, O'Connell says",
          "body": "Sam Prendergast is winning his race for fitness ahead of Friday's game against the Pumas. He picked up a wrist injury in a Leinster-Munster interpro last month, but assistant coach Paul O'Connell says the 23-year-old has stepped up training, jumping in and out of non-contact sessions and bits close to full-contact. \"I'm not 100% sure, but he looks like he could be OK.\" Prendergast appears to be the only injury concern for Irish management, with Jimmy O'Brien back in full training after a concussion."
        },
