          "body": "Writing in January, Roar contributor Julius2934 asks whether Australia are ready for a 24-team World Cup, a field the column says has been questioned since the draw. Sceptics ask whether 24 sides are really worthy of the tournament and whether it will dilute quality. The piece starts by comparing rugby with other sports' World Cups, noting World Rugby has 134 members."
