          "heading": "Scott Barrett moves on from losing All Blacks captaincy to Ardie Savea",
          "body": "Scott Barrett has reflected on the change, pointing to Kane Williamson, the former Black Caps captain who let go of the role and kept playing. Dave Rennie, who handed the leadership to Ardie Savea when he took over, has described Barrett as \"a bit of a reluctant captain\". Barrett missed the whole Super Rugby Pacific season through injury and was back for the Bledisloe Cup Tests before being named in the touring squad for the November leg of the Nations Championship."
